{"meta":{"id":"promise","category":"it/syntax/typescript/network","title":"Promise (.then) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"Promise 를 .then() 으로 연결, .catch / .finally, new Promise 로 만들기","tags":["typescript","f-network","f-async"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">Promise (.then) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Promise 를 .then() 으로 연결, .catch / .finally, new Promise 로 만들기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Promise — .then() 으로 연결</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">getUser(1)\r\n  .then((user) =&gt; getOrders(user.id))   // 반환한 Promise 가 다음 then 으로\r\n  .then((orders) =&gt; render(orders))\r\n  .catch((e) =&gt; console.error(e))       // 어느 단계에서든 실패하면 여기로\r\n  .finally(() =&gt; hideLoading());</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Promise 만들기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function delay(ms: number): Promise&lt;void&gt; {\r\n  return new Promise((resolve) =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, ms));\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction readJson&lt;T&gt;(text: string): Promise&lt;T&gt; {\r\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {\r\n    try { resolve(JSON.parse(text)); }\r\n    catch (e) { reject(e); }\r\n  });\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">상태: 대기(pending) → 이행(fulfilled, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>resolve</code>) 또는 거부(rejected, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>reject</code>)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">then vs async/await</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">.then()</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">async / await</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">형태</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">콜백 체인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">동기 코드처럼 위→아래</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">오류 처리</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">.catch()</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">try / catch</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-orange-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">결과</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">같음 — async/await 도 내부적으로 Promise</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network/promise","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/typescript/network"}],"hasImage":false}